    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n`get_scrolloffpad_value()` takes a window, but its else branch reads `curwin->w_p_sop` instead of `wp->w_p_sop`.\r\n\r\nReachable from Vimscript, since `line('w0', winid)` runs `update_topline()` on another window without making it current.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nRead the option from the window that was passed in.",
